  "short": "proxy-traffic",
  "description": {
    "zh_CN": "按来源 IP 汇总代理流量。Clash API 内核统计精确流量，Xray access log 降级统计连接次数；支持 sing-box / Xray 节点创建、订阅节点库、长短链订阅和分流规则可视化编辑。",
    "en": "Aggregates proxy traffic by source IP, with Clash API and Xray access-log modes, node provisioning, subscriptions, and a visual YAML rule editor."
  },
  "author": "Syngnat",
  "version": "2.2.5",
  "url": "https://github.com/Syngnat/komari-proxy-traffic",
